# VERITAS AI — Frontend Environment Template
# Copy to frontend/.env for local development

# Optional. Leave unset: the app calls /api/v1 on its own origin (nginx in Docker, the Vite dev server otherwise).
# Set it only to point the browser at an API on a different origin, e.g. https://api.example.com (then also set
# FRONTEND_URL on the backend for CORS).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
